  "common_safety_shell": {
    "ablatable": false,
    "invariants": [
      "environment observation remains canonical for environment state",
      "direct observation, derived state, hypothesis, plan, action, and outcome remain distinct",
      "no role can authorize its own external effect",
      "Kaggle staging and competition ignition remain separate human gates",
      "a disabled mechanism cannot silently fall back to a broader mechanism"
